{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19792","headline":"车遥遥 · 孟郊","name":"车遥遥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路喜到江尽，江上又通舟。\n舟车两无阻，何处不得游。\n丈夫四方志，女子安可留。\n郎自别日言，无令生远愁。\n旅雁忽呌月，断猿寒啼秋。\n此夕梦君梦，君在百城楼。\n寄泪无因波，寄恨无因輈。\n愿爲驭者手，与郎回马头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}